# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal Engine (Lyra Starter Game) — 版本控制忽略规则
# 原则：只跟踪源码与资源（Source / Config / Build / Content / *.uproject），
#       不跟踪任何可再生的编译产物与本地缓存。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 引擎生成 / 编译产物（任意层级，包括 Plugins 下） ---
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Build/Receipts/

# --- Visual Studio / Rider / IDE ---
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
ipch/
.vscode/

# --- 构建脚本的中间产物 ---
Build/Scripts/obj/
Build/Scripts/uatobj/

# --- 调试符号 / 日志 / 转储 ---
*.pdb
*.log
*.dmp
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.bak
*.tmp

# --- 本地资源收集（每台机器不同） ---
Content/Collections/

# --- 操作系统杂项 ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
